abstract: >-
  Zero-dependency Node.js ESM, Python 3, and WebGL 2.0 multi-scale Artificial Life
  observatory supervising eight local endpoints across seven public repositories on
  127.0.0.1:8790. Enforces strict render-only D7 observer isolation (D7RO), loopback
  CSRF/CSWSH and path-traversal security boundaries, bounded bare-metal 1..1,000,000
  population controls differentially verified between Node and Python, 112-trait spectral
  differentials with <=240 omnitemporal history ring capping, and 6/6 (100.0%) surgical
  mutation-kill coverage. Strictly a visualization and orchestration instrument; retires
  0/1,900 overarching Mega-Atlas open problems.
